  "description": "Engineered for fun, confidence and control, the Vitus 24 is all this and more. With every aspect of children’s riding ability’s taken into consideration.\n\nThe 24 is built around an easy-to-handle light weight 6061-T6 aluminium frameset. Aided by 8 speed Shimano Acera drivetrain triggered by a thumbshift shifter to allow easy gear changing.\n\nFor the 24\" wheel performance, Vitus have fitted one more gear to give a Shimano 8 speed drivetrain, including a Acera rear derailleur and thumb shifter both these offer a light action performance making it easier for kids change gear.\n\nTo ensure that your child can stop with ease, Vitus have bolted on a set of Tektro V-Brakes to give a solid braking performance. Along with these they have got short pull levers making it that little bit easier for the children to reach the levers.\n\nRest assured that each Vitus bike is fully built, tested and tuned by our exclusive retail partners team of qualified bike mechanics to ensure your bike arrives in perfect condition.",
